.TH KEYMENU 1 "2026-11-26" "keymenu 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
keymenu \- dmenu KeePass/KDBX password menu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keymenu
.B \-\-db
.I PATH
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B KEYMENU_DB=\fIPATH\fP keymenu
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B keymenu
unlocks a KeePass database, lets you pick an entry with
.BR dmenu (1),
then always shows an action menu (Password, Username, Autotype).
Passwords are placed on the X11 CLIPBOARD with a timed clear, or typed
via libXtst. There is no daemon and no KeePassXC dependency.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-db " PATH"
Path to the \fI.kdbx\fP file. Alternatively set \fBKEYMENU_DB\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-keyfile " PATH"
Optional keyfile. Alternatively set \fBKEYMENU_KEYFILE\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-ttl " SECS"
Clipboard ownership lifetime in seconds (default 45). Also
\fBKEYMENU_CLIPBOARD_TTL\fP.
.TP
.BI \-\-dmenu " CMD"
dmenu executable (default \fBdmenu\fP). Also \fBKEYMENU_DMENU\fP.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KEYMENU_DB
Default database path.
.TP
.B KEYMENU_KEYFILE
Optional keyfile path.
.TP
.B KEYMENU_DMENU
Override dmenu binary.
.TP
.B KEYMENU_CLIPBOARD_TTL
Clipboard TTL in seconds.
.TP
.B DISPLAY
Required for interactive use (dmenu, clipboard, autotype).
.SH RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES
dmenu on PATH; libX11.so.6; libXtst.so.6.
.SH FILES
Saves use a temporary sibling file then \fBrename\fP(2). Backup vaults
before editing: \fBsave_kdbx4\fP is experimental and upgrades KDBX 3.1 to 4.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dmenu (1)
.SH NOTES
Master password is prompted with dmenu \fB\-P\fP when available.
Autotype is ASCII-first. Build against system X libs via pkg-config;
do not enable \fB\-C prefer\-dynamic\fP for normal installs.
